00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:54.628
K I R I O U S and A


00:05:54.663 --> 00:05:54.708
K I R I O U S and A L


00:05:54.743 --> 00:05:54.788
K I R I O U S and A L O


00:05:54.823 --> 00:05:54.908
